// Barrowstone's pack: Greystone's (data/packs/greystone.ron), its face coursed rubble, stones
// of every size set in lime mortar (Poly Haven's `castle_wall_varriation`, CC0,
// assets/materials/README.md), as a barrow's or crypt's walls are laid: round 2-5's barrow
// reviewers read the fieldstone as uniform cobbles, no joints between. The scan is already
// grey, so the tint only darkens it toward Greystone's value and cools it a touch.
(
    pack: "greystone",
    tint: (0.70, 0.70, 0.72),
    textures: {
        Masonry: (path: "materials/castle_wall_varriation", metres: (2.0, 2.0), depth: 0.025),
    },
)
